<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Onboarding — Step 2: Generate Your Skills Bank</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'><rect width='32' height='32' rx='6' fill='%231e293b'/><rect x='8' y='13' width='16' height='11' rx='2' fill='%2322c55e'/><rect x='12' y='10' width='8' height='5' rx='1.5' fill='none' stroke='%2322c55e' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='15' y='17' width='2' height='3' rx='1' fill='%231e293b'/></svg>">
<style>
  :root {
    --blue: #3b82f6; --gray: #6b7280; --light: #f9fafb;
    --border: #e5e7eb; --text: #111827; --radius: 8px;
    --green: #22c55e; --red: #ef4444;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
         background: var(--light); color: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }

  .header { background: #1e293b; color: white; padding: 12px 20px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
  .header a { color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; }
  .header a:hover { color: white; }
  .header h1 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }

  .main { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 20px; }

  .step-indicator { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px; align-items: center; }
  .step-dot { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%;
              display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
              font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .step-dot.active { background: #1e293b; color: white; }
  .step-dot.done { background: var(--green); color: white; }
  .step-dot.pending { background: var(--border); color: var(--gray); }
  .step-line { width: 24px; height: 2px; background: var(--border); }

  h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  p.sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 20px; }

  .instructions { background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fde68a; border-radius: var(--radius);
                  padding: 16px 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .instructions strong { color: #92400e; }
  .instructions ol { margin: 8px 0 0 20px; }

  .prompt-box { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .prompt-box textarea {
    width: 100%; min-height: 400px; padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-family: "SF Mono", "Fira Code", monospace; font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6; resize: vertical; background: white; color: var(--text);
    outline: none;
  }
  .prompt-box textarea:focus { border-color: var(--blue); }

  .copy-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .btn-copy {
    background: #1e293b; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 10px 24px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn-copy:hover { background: #334155; }
  .copy-confirm { font-size: 13px; color: #16a34a; display: none; }

  .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .btn-primary { background: #16a34a; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 6px;
                 padding: 10px 24px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: #15803d; }
  .btn-secondary { background: white; color: #374151; border: 1px solid var(--border);
                   border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 24px; font-size: 14px;
                   font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; }
  .btn-secondary:hover { background: #f9fafb; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <a href="/onboard?step=1">← Back</a>
  <h1>Onboarding — Generate Your Skills Bank</h1>
</div>

<div class="main">

  <div class="step-indicator">
    <span class="step-dot done">✓</span>
    <span class="step-line"></span>
    <span class="step-dot active">2</span>
    <span class="step-line"></span>
    <span class="step-dot pending">3</span>
    <span class="step-line"></span>
    <span class="step-dot pending">4</span>
  </div>

  <h2>Generate your skills bank with AI</h2>
  <p class="sub">
    You'll send your resume documents to an LLM (like Claude.ai or ChatGPT) along with a
    structured prompt. The LLM will extract your experience and format it ready for the tool.
  </p>

  <div class="instructions">
    <strong>How this works:</strong>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Copy the prompt below</strong> (click "Copy prompt")</li>
      <li>Go to your preferred LLM tool (Claude.ai, ChatGPT, etc.)</li>
      <li>Paste the prompt into a <strong>new conversation</strong></li>
      <li><strong>Upload 2-3 versions of your resume</strong> (PDF or text) to the conversation</li>
      <li>Submit and wait for the LLM to generate your structured YAML output</li>
      <li><strong>Download or copy the YAML output</strong> and come back to Step 3 to upload it</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="section-label" style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:8px;">Ready-to-paste prompt</div>
  <div class="prompt-box">
    <textarea id="prompt-text" readonly>{{ prompt }}</textarea>
  </div>

  <div class="copy-bar">
    <button class="btn-copy" onclick="copyPrompt()">📋 Copy prompt</button>
    <span class="copy-confirm" id="copy-confirm">Copied to clipboard ✓</span>
  </div>

  <div class="actions">
    <a href="/onboard?step=1" class="btn-secondary">← Back</a>
    <a href="/onboard?step=3" class="btn-primary">I have my YAML file →</a>
  </div>

</div>

<script>
function copyPrompt() {
  const ta = document.getElementById('prompt-text');
  ta.select();
  ta.setSelectionRange(0, 99999);
  navigator.clipboard.writeText(ta.value).then(() => {
    const el = document.getElementById('copy-confirm');
    el.style.display = 'inline';
    setTimeout(() => el.style.display = 'none', 2000);
  });
}
</script>

</body>
</html>